---
const home='https://z-q-chen.github.io/cloudtogether/';
const repo='https://github.com/z-q-chen/CloudTogether';
const release=repo+'/releases/tag/v0.1.0';
const download=repo+'/releases/download/v0.1.0/CloudTogether-0.1.0-linux-x64.tar.gz';
const article='/articles/cloudtogether-010/';
const skins=[['夜航','#17191f','#ed9674'],['唱片纸','#f8f9fb','#ce4547'],['苔原','#101b18','#94c9aa'],['玫瑰灰','#fbf6f7','#b05377'],['海盐','#f1f7fb','#3f83b5'],['琥珀','#211c18','#e1b273']];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
  <title>云伴 CloudTogether — 音乐，有人作伴。</title>
  <meta name="description" content="连接网易云音乐的 Linux 桌面客户端。发现音乐、账号歌单、共同聆听与桌面歌词。"/>
  <link rel="canonical" href={home}/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/cloudtogether/icon.svg"/>
  <meta property="og:title" content="云伴 — 音乐，有人作伴。"/><meta property="og:description" content="把喜欢的音乐与共同聆听的时光留在桌面。"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content={home}/><meta property="og:image" content={home+'social.png'}/>
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f3ec"/>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
<header class="masthead wrap">
  <a class="brand" href="/cloudtogether/" aria-label="云伴官网"><img src="/cloudtogether/icon.svg" alt="" width="40" height="40"/><span>云伴<small>CloudTogether</small></span></a>
  <nav aria-label="官网导航"><a href="#features">功能</a><a href={article}>设计手记</a><a href={repo}>GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
  <a class="nav-download" href={download}>下载 Linux 版 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
</header>
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> CLOUDTOGETHER · LINUX DESKTOP</p><h1>音乐，<br/>有人<span class="accent">作伴。</span></h1><p class="hero-intro">好歌从发现开始。<br/>把喜欢的音乐、一起听的时光，留在桌面。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={download}>下载云伴 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#app">先看一眼 <span aria-hidden="true">↙</span></a></div><p class="platform">Ubuntu / Linux x86_64 · 开源</p></div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-caption"><span>NOW PLAYING</span><span>01 / TOGETHER</span></div><div class="disc"><div class="disc-label"><img src="/cloudtogether/brand-mark.svg" alt=""/><span>云伴</span><small>SIDE A · 音乐，与你。</small></div></div><div class="record-sleeve"><svg viewBox="0 0 350 350"><path d="M0 275C65 181 119 186 181 230S290 264 350 139V350H0Z" fill="#cb6f4c"/><path d="M0 305C77 251 118 283 170 307S287 328 350 262V350H0Z" fill="#43534b"/><circle cx="245" cy="94" r="49" fill="#f0ca92"/><path d="M51 50h35M51 50v35m248 164v35h-35" fill="none" stroke="#657164" stroke-width="1"/></svg><span>音乐，与你。</span><small>CLOUDTOGETHER / VOL. 01</small></div><div class="art-note"><span>♪</span><p>同一首歌，<br/>也可以有两个人的故事。</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="app-section wrap" id="app"><div class="section-top"><p class="eyebrow">01 / 你的桌面，回到音乐</p><p>夜航皮肤</p></div><div class="window-frame"><div class="window-top"><span class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>云伴 · CloudTogether</span><span>Linux</span></div><img class="app-shot" src="/cloudtogether/discover.webp" width="1360" height="795" alt="云伴真实发现页，展示推荐歌单、一起听入口及常驻底部播放器" fetchpriority="high"/></div><p class="shot-caption">打开应用，直接进入发现。</p></section>
  <section class="features wrap" id="features"><div class="section-top"><p class="eyebrow">02 / 把听歌这件事，做好</p><span class="edition">找歌、播放与账号歌单。</span></div><h2>从一首新歌，<br/>到一个熟悉的人。</h2><div class="feature-grid">
    <article><span class="feature-no">01</span><h3>发现下一首喜欢</h3><p>推荐、分类歌单、排行榜、新碟、听书与播客。登录后，还能查看每日推荐与使用心动模式。</p><a href={article+'#把入口留给音乐'}>看看发现页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="feature-no">02</span><h3>我的音乐，来自我的账号</h3><p>扫码登录，查看账号里创建与收藏的歌单、喜欢的音乐。</p><a href={article+'#把入口留给音乐'}>了解账号同步 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="feature-no">03</span><h3>切换页面，音乐继续</h3><p>日常使用底部播放栏，需要看封面与歌词时展开播放页。支持自动联播、单曲循环、随机与心动推荐。</p><a href={article+'#让两个人共享播放决定'}>了解播放体验 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="together-section"><div class="together-grid wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / 一起听 · 试用</p><h2>陪伴，<br/>不从零开始。</h2><p class="section-copy">邀请一个人加入房间，用共同队列听同一首歌。</p><p class="section-copy">累计时长连接云端记录，让此前一起听过的时间留在这里。</p><a class="text-link" href={article+'#让两个人共享播放决定'}>读一起听的设计 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="together-visual" aria-label="一起听累计时长界面示意"><div class="pair"><div class="portrait first"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="35" r="19" fill="#e8cba0"/><path d="M3 100c0-55 94-55 94 0" fill="#9ca68c"/></svg></div><span class="pair-line">♪</span><div class="portrait second"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="35" r="19" fill="#d49b7e"/><path d="M3 100c0-55 94-55 94 0" fill="#e4d0b1"/></svg></div></div><span class="stat-label">与你的听友 · 累计一起听</span><p class="time-stat"><b>几千</b><span>小时，<br/>仍有下一首。</span></p><div class="stat-bottom"><span class="live-dot"></span>官方云端累计记录<span class="illustration-label">界面示意</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="lyrics-section wrap"><div class="lyrics-visual"><span class="desk-caption">你在做别的事，歌词在这里。</span><div class="lyric-window"><div class="lyric-toolbar"><img src="/cloudtogether/brand-mark.svg" alt="" width="20"/><span>云伴 · 桌面歌词</span><span class="lyric-tool-label">A− &nbsp; A+ &nbsp; ×</span></div><p>音乐，有人作伴。</p><small>下一句，也一起听。</small><div class="lyric-foot">界面示意 · 拖动顶部移动，调整窗口与字号</div></div><div class="desk-rule"></div></div><div class="lyrics-copy"><p class="eyebrow">04 / 留一句，在桌面</p><h2>歌词，<br/>跟着你的日常。</h2><p class="section-copy">点一下「词」，打开独立置顶的歌词小窗。当前句、翻译和下一句同步更新，主窗口最小化后也能继续看。</p><p class="section-copy">拖动、缩放、调整字号。关掉小窗，音乐照常播放。</p><a class="text-link" href={article+'#把歌词放进工作场景'}>了解桌面歌词 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="skin-section wrap"><div class="section-top"><p class="eyebrow">05 / 今天，想用哪一种颜色？</p><span>思源黑体 / 思源宋体，随包提供</span></div><div class="skin-grid">{skins.map(([name,bg,accent])=><div class="skin-swatch" style={`--skin-bg:${bg};--skin-accent:${accent}`}><div class="skin-preview"><div></div><span></span><i></i></div><span>{name}</span></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="download-section wrap" id="download"><div><p class="eyebrow">CLOUDTOGETHER</p><h2>下一首，<br/>在桌面相见。</h2></div><div class="download-copy"><a class="button primary" href={download}>下载 Linux 版 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><p>Ubuntu / Linux x86_64 · 约 157 MB</p><div class="download-links"><a href={release}>发行说明 ↗</a><a href={repo}>查看源码 ↗</a></div><details><summary>下载后怎么打开？</summary><ol><li>下载压缩包并解压。</li><li>运行「启动云伴.sh」。脚本自动解包 AppImage，不依赖 FUSE。</li><li>可选运行「安装到应用菜单.sh」，添加图标与启动入口。</li></ol><p>如果文件管理器没有直接运行脚本的入口，可在该文件夹打开终端，执行 <code>sh 启动云伴.sh</code>。</p></details></div></section>

</main>
<footer class="footer wrap"><a class="brand" href="/cloudtogether/"><img src="/cloudtogether/icon.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"/><span>云伴<small>音乐，有人作伴。</small></span></a><p>2026 · ECHO · API：<a href="https://github.com/NeteaseCloudMusicApiEnhanced/api-enhanced">NeteaseCloudMusicApiEnhanced</a></p><div><a href={article}>设计手记</a><a href={repo}>GitHub ↗</a><a href="/">ECHO 的博客 ↗</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style is:global>
:root{--paper:#f6f3ec;--ink:#272d29;--muted:#687068;--accent:#b95033;--line:#dcded2;--serif:'Noto Serif CJK SC','Source Han Serif SC',Songti SC,serif;--sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans CJK SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:28px}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button,a,summary{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:6px}a:hover{color:var(--accent)}img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto}p,h1,h2,h3{margin:0}h1,h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.24}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 96px));margin:0 auto}.skip{position:fixed;top:-70px;left:16px;z-index:20;background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:8px 20px}.skip:focus{top:10px}.masthead{height:110px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0}.brand>span{font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em}.brand small{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.05em;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}.masthead nav{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-left:auto;font-size:13px}.nav-download{font-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:9px 17px;border-radius:5px}.nav-download span{margin-left:14px}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:48px;padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:75px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.live-dot{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;background:#6e8b74;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}.hero h1{font-size:78px;margin:25px 0 22px}.accent{color:var(--accent)}.hero-intro{font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted)}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;margin-top:30px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:45px;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:5px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fffdf7}.primary:hover{background:#9f432c;color:#fff}.text-link{font-size:13px;display:inline-block}.text-link span{margin-left:16px}.platform{margin-top:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.hero-art{position:relative;min-height:425px;padding-top:26px}.art-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid #b9c1b4;padding-top:12px}.disc{position:absolute;top:67px;right:1px;width:310px;height:310px;border-radius:50%;background:repeating-radial-gradient(circle,#262c28 0,#262c28 3px,#343d34 4px,#262c28 5px);box-shadow:0 10px 18px #272d2917;display:grid;place-items:center}.disc:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:50%}.disc-label{background:#d49c6d;width:128px;height:128px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#332e25}.disc-label img{width:33px;opacity:.9;margin-bottom:2px}.disc-label>span{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.2em}.disc-label small{font-size:6px;margin-top:14px}.record-sleeve{position:absolute;top:93px;left:7px;width:280px;height:280px;background:#dde1d1;transform:rotate(-8deg);box-shadow:0 14px 24px #272d2921;overflow:hidden}.record-sleeve svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}.record-sleeve>span{position:absolute;left:24px;top:27px;writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;letter-spacing:4px}.record-sleeve>small{position:absolute;left:23px;bottom:21px;color:#f6e6c5;font-size:6px;letter-spacing:1.5px}.art-note{position:absolute;right:5px;bottom:0;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}.art-note>span{font-size:30px;color:var(--accent);line-height:1}.art-note p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.section-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:20px}.section-top>p:last-child:not(.eyebrow),.section-top>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.window-frame{border:1px solid #d2d7cf;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 25px 55px #26322612;background:#191b21}.window-top{height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 14px;color:#bac0bc;font-size:10px;line-height:1}.window-dots{display:flex;gap:5px}.window-dots i{width:6px;height:6px;background:#5d645e;border-radius:50%}.window-top>span:last-child{font-size:9px}.app-shot{width:100%}.shot-caption{margin-top:13px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.features{padding-top:110px;padding-bottom:85px}.features h2{font-size:47px;margin:32px 0 48px}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px}.feature-grid article{border-top:1px solid #b9c1b4;padding-top:20px}.feature-no{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--accent)}.feature-grid h3{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:500;margin:12px 0 15px}.feature-grid p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;color:var(--muted)}.feature-grid a{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;margin-top:25px}.feature-grid a span{margin-left:8px}.together-section{background:#e7eade;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd1;border-bottom:1px solid #d9dfd1}.together-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:110px;padding-top:75px;padding-bottom:75px;align-items:center}.together-grid h2,.lyrics-section h2{font-size:49px;margin:23px 0}.section-copy{font-size:14px;line-height:1.95;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:17px;max-width:420px}.together-grid .text-link,.lyrics-section .text-link{margin-top:7px}.together-visual{background:#f6f3ec;border:1px solid #cdd5c7;border-radius:12px;padding:35px 35px 25px;box-shadow:0 17px 25px #43534b0a;transform:rotate(2deg)}.pair{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;margin-bottom:30px}.portrait{width:82px;height:82px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden}.first{background:#43554a}.second{background:#706455}.pair-line{color:#8f9b87;font-size:28px}.stat-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.time-stat{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding-top:7px;padding-bottom:28px}.time-stat b{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:63px;line-height:1.4}.time-stat>span{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#65725d}.stat-bottom{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:17px;display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.illustration-label{margin-left:auto;opacity:.7;font-size:9px}.lyrics-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:95px;align-items:center;padding-top:110px;padding-bottom:80px}.lyrics-visual{position:relative;padding:60px 15px 50px}.desk-caption{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:14px;color:#849080;position:absolute;top:5px;left:17px}.lyric-window{position:relative;background:#242a27;color:#f4eddf;border-radius:9px;padding:20px 25px;box-shadow:0 20px 30px #43534b18;transform:rotate(-2deg)}.lyric-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#c2c8ba;font-size:9px}.lyric-toolbar img{filter:brightness(2)}.lyric-tool-label{margin-left:auto}.lyric-window>p{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:31px;margin-top:27px;line-height:1.4}.lyric-window>small{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#9eaa9d;margin-top:10px}.lyric-foot{margin-top:29px;font-size:9px;color:#7e8c7c;border-top:1px solid #3c453b;padding-top:10px}.desk-rule{margin-top:44px;height:1px;background:#c9d2c2;width:80%;margin-left:10%}.skin-section{padding-top:45px;padding-bottom:90px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.skin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:17px;margin-top:30px}.skin-preview{height:110px;background:var(--skin-bg);border:1px solid #272d2917;border-radius:7px;position:relative;padding:17px;overflow:hidden}.skin-preview>div{width:39px;height:39px;background:var(--skin-accent);border-radius:4px;opacity:.5}.skin-preview>span{position:absolute;left:66px;right:15px;top:23px;height:3px;background:var(--skin-accent);opacity:.6}.skin-preview>span:after{content:'';display:block;margin-top:9px;height:2px;background:var(--skin-accent);width:70%;opacity:.4}.skin-preview>i{position:absolute;bottom:15px;left:calc(50% - 10px);width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--skin-accent)}.skin-swatch>span{font-size:11px;display:block;margin-top:9px;color:var(--muted)}.download-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:110px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:65px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.download-section h2{font-size:51px;margin-top:23px}.download-copy{padding-top:13px}.download-copy>.button{width:100%;padding:17px 23px}.download-copy>p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.download-links{display:flex;gap:23px;margin-top:17px;font-size:12px}.download-copy details{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}.download-copy ol{padding-left:21px}.download-copy code{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.release-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:50px;padding-top:25px;padding-bottom:30px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.release-note>p{letter-spacing:.05em}.release-note>div>p+p{margin-top:11px}.release-note a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);height:110px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px}.footer .brand>span{font-size:16px}.footer .brand small{font-size:9px}.footer>p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:auto}.footer>div{display:flex;gap:25px;font-size:11px}
